# Google Maps Platform API Key for SvelteKit (loaded via $env/dynamic/public)
#
# Quickstart for Prototyping (Free Maps Demo Key - no billing setup required):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Generate and copy your Demo Key, then paste it below into a local `.env` file.
#    (Note: Maps Demo Key has daily reset limits and is for prototyping only.)
#
# For Production:
# Create a restricted API key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Address Validation API, Routes API, Maps Static API.
# Restrict by HTTP referrer and designated APIs.
PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
